"description": "Global Payments, Inc. engages in the provision of payment technology and software solutions. It operates through the Merchant Solutions and Issuer Solutions segments. The Merchant Solutions segment offers payment technology and software solutions globally, primarily to small and medium-sized businesses, as well as select mid-market and enterprise customers. The Issuer Solutions segment provides comprehensive commerce solutions that support the payment ecosystem for issuers. The company was founded by George W. Thorpe in 1967 and is headquartered in Atlanta, GA.",
